        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa OMWAMI yali nasunjile mbu shiyakhasiliisia eliira liaIsiraeli hasi welikulu ta; kho nabahonia khulwa omukhono kwaYeroboamu waYoashi.",
          "type": "text",
