        {
          "text": "Ne amakhuwa kandi kaYeroboamu, nende kosi aka yakhola, nakobululubwe, shinga olwa yaseelanga amahe khandi shinga olwa yakalusilia Isiraeli Damasiko nende Hamatsi, ebialinji nibili biaYuda, shikahandiikwa muShitabu shiAmakhuwa keTsindaalo akabaruchi baIsiraeli? ",
          "type": "text",
